%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/io_test.clj:149 (readXml-nullValueOn-test)
testing: nullValueOn none - nothing becomes nil
元の形: io/readXml の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
read("<root><empty></empty><value>text</value></root>", "application/xml", {"nullValueOn": "none"})
%%% output application/json
{
  "root": {
    "empty": "",
    "value": "text"
  }
}
